                </zone>
                <zone h='5000' id='13' type-v2='text' w='98666' x='667' y='6250'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Madhya Pradesh and Maharashtra bring in 46% of revenue and 47% of profit. Six city rows lose money (about ₹5,800 in total), and Chennai alone lost ₹2,216. Mumbai has the most orders (68) but only a 2.6% margin.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
